  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4ce984ec2ebdb932c116fae92a6fc15bcb1159c62d6df2b60a4a3b84ce39f145",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Phew...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "L.G.D.'s escort team has managed to leave safely.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "But... it doesn't look like our enemies have any intention on letting us go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "As long as they don't know that Misha has left with the L.G.D., they'll continue to focus their efforts on us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Misha will be safer this way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Now that I think about it, why are both Reunion and Lungmen after this kid?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I can't say for sure. There are a lot of possibilities.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "My best guess is that either she, or something she knows, is significant enough to determine Lungmen's continued safety.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Something?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Yes, perhaps some intel or information...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "So that's why both Lungmen and Reunion are after her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "What a dangerous contest...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "And none of us can stay out of it, not us, Misha, or the L.G.D.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Hopefully we don't end up caught in the crossfire.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "We don't know anything, but we have to take care of everything...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I, I'm not quite sure...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But as for Madam Ch'en...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I have a hunch... that things aren't going to end so smoothly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Amiya, is there anything left for us to do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Should we accompany you back to Rhodes Island?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "No thank you. Nothing is holding us back in combat anymore, so we should be fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "If that's the case, we'll head back and wait for further orders.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "No problem.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Moving forward, I hope you'll continue to keep an eye out on Reunion's movements within Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Even though we've handed Misha over to the L.G.D., the fact that Reunion is here... still makes me uneasy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Easily done~ We'll be on our way now~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Mhm. I'll leave you to it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Everyone, we don't know how many more Reunion members there are in hiding.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Make sure to stay prepared and alert.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Next, we'll continue to relocate our operations within these high-rises.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "If necessary, we can even use the rooftops.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This way, we'll have a terrain advantage versus having to fight Reunion out in the streets.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "If necessary, we'll draw them towards areas that we control!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Operators",
      "text": "Roger!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "Talulah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "The preparations are complete.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "It's time to make our move.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "--Speak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "There actually is a strategic purpose for us to attack Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "If we can take control of Lungmen, Reunion will have a huge advantage.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "Of course, this comes with a high risk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "...Why are you preoccupied with this idea?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Do you see that structure over there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "I see it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "That's the symbol of Lungmen... It's also...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "I didn't come back here just to return everything that has been taken from the Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "I will also... make him pay.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Above all... Don't you think that... things are getting very interesting?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Don't you agree... Talulah?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
